note The header runs and the button list, built here for both measuring and drawing: step number, name, off-path tag, file:lines; then more/less when the view is longer than PREVIEW_LINES, context above, below and none (never while cut to a preview, and above or below only when the file has more lines there), source, '+ step' on an off-path node while a path is read, and the two reveals. A reveal that is open says 'hide N' and closes on a click; a closed one is offered only when it would reveal something, so a button whose targets are all on the canvas already is not drawn at all rather than doing nothing when pressed.

