file crates/gui/src/graph/build.rs
symbol rebuild
lines 0 24
hash cf30fa07b8d48df4
note The derivation, run every frame from App::graph_layout: an empty Built for the selected path with the graph's direction, then the path's steps, then the kept off-path root at rank 0 when no step shows it, then the reveals, then the focus when it is still not on the canvas - with a second pass over the reveal list add_focus returns, which may carry the focus's own auto-opened neighbourhood - then every node's view. Because the kept root and the reveals come before the focus, clicking an off-path node that is already on the canvas selects it without re-rooting the tree or adding nodes.

