symbol add_focus
lines 0 21
hash 0004b21d11b8e91d
note The focused symbol as its own root at rank 0, only when no node shows it yet; otherwise None and nothing changes. Unless this very node was auto-opened before, its callers and its callees are appended to the reveal list it returns and auto_open is set, so an off-path jump lands in a neighbourhood rather than on a lone box; rebuild replays the list, and App::graph_layout then records it with an AutoOpen action, which also makes the node the kept root, and rebuilds, which makes the opening part of the reader's list, so closing either side afterwards sticks.

