file crates/gui/src/graph/build.rs
symbol Built
lines 0 16
hash 891cbc4a5e861add
note What rebuild derives, rebuilt from nothing every frame and moved into GraphState by a Built action, which also drops dragged positions and context for nodes that no longer exist. nodes is the insertion order; rank is each node's lane and doubles as the set of nodes; position and size are in cells, written by the layout and measure; range is a node's own lines (the step's slice or the whole symbol) and view is that range widened by context and clamped to the file; by_symbol is the first node per symbol; path is the selected path's slot when it is in range; step maps a step node to its StepInfo, step_parent to its parent step's node, origin maps a revealed node to what revealed it; has_note marks step nodes with a note, which take one more row; auto_open is set when this rebuild opened the focus's neighbourhood; direction is copied from GraphState for the layout and the edges; siblings are the boxes of children the layout placed together.

